WEBVTT

02:23:01.459 --> 02:23:03.250
But not telling you
meant risking your lives.

02:23:06.084 --> 02:23:07.167
I don't get it, Dad.

02:23:10.125 --> 02:23:11.625
Forget about us.

02:23:13.542 --> 02:23:15.042
If you tell them that it's you…

02:23:16.709 --> 02:23:19.834
what's the point of
everything you've done so far?
